---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-i-work">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading id="how-i-work" index="03" title="How I Work" subtitle="The work is technical. The impact is collaborative." />
    <div class="grid principles">
      <article class="card principle">
        <h3>Make complexity visible</h3>
        <p>I break ambiguous requirements into clear engineering work so teams can execute with confidence.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card principle">
        <h3>Design for reliability</h3>
        <p>I think through failure modes, retries, concurrency, and idempotency early in system design.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card principle">
        <h3>Raise the quality bar</h3>
        <p>I use code review, standards, and mentoring to improve technical quality over time.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card principle">
        <h3>Stay close to product needs</h3>
        <p>I collaborate across product and customer feedback loops to deliver practical outcomes.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
